<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 58-3 V AUSTRALIA AT LUNCH IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 58-3 V AUSTRALIA AT LUNCH IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 58 for</p>
<p>three at lunch on the first day of the first test against</p>
<p>Australia at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
</text>
